1
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,320
Go set up a new platform.

2
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:52,960
Thank you, sir.

3
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:53,759
Thank you, sir.

4
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:37,680
Hello, sir.

5
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:39,120
Gu Ting.

6
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:41,920
I've been thinking about this a lot.

7
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,120
I think I need to tell you.

8
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,640
Otherwise,

9
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,480
I'd feel like I'm letting you down.

10
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,680
I'm sorry, sir.

11
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,680
I appreciate your feelings,

12
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,400
but I really can't return them.

13
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,040
Gu Ting,

14
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:57,239
you misunderstood.

15
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,519
I'm calling

16
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:01,680
about your father.

17
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:03,159
My dad?

18
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:05,239
Didn't you tell me before

19
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:08,000
that your father doesn't have a proper job?

20
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:09,960
Yeah.

21
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,319
Is there a problem with his job?

22
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:15,680
He is actually a fraudster.

23
00:02:17,439 --> 00:02:18,639
Teacher Yan.

24
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,120
Even though my dad is unreliable,

25
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,080
he could never be a fraudster.

26
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:24,800
I wanted to talk to you properly,

27
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,280
but I never expected you to be like this.

28
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,120
I knew you wouldn't believe me.

29
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,199
I'll send you the documents.

30
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,000
See for yourself.

31
00:02:58,879 --> 00:02:59,680
All this...

32
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,479
...was done by my dad.

33
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,800
A police friend of mine

34
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:08,879
mentioned your father, Gu Yan, in passing,

35
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:12,439
saying he's a fraudster on the run.

36
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:15,919
Don't worry.

37
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,800
I didn't report him.

38
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,599
But I have to tell you,

39
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:25,719
I can't bear to see him sent to prison.

40
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,879
Gu Ting.

41
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:36,400
My dad is getting old...

42
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:37,800
Gu Ting.

43
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,080
Let me handle this.

44
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,280
Come to the school now.

45
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:44,080
Let's have a proper talk

46
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:46,199
about how to help your father.

47
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,680
There's no need, sir.

48
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:51,120
I'll handle this myself.

49
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,360
Honey, you're back.

50
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,600
Look what Dad just bought you. Want it?

51
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,480
I...

52
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,120
This...

53
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,639
Dad bought this for you.

54
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:42,120
You could at least take a look.

55
00:04:49,199 --> 00:04:51,759
I admit that recently,

56
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,879
well...

57
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:56,079
I haven't been there for you enough.

58
00:04:58,639 --> 00:04:59,240
That's mainly because Dad

59
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,879
has been really busy with work lately.

60
00:05:00,879 --> 00:05:02,240
Then let me ask you,

61
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,560
what exactly do you do for work?

62
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:09,040
Depends on when you mean.

63
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:12,800
Dad has done all kinds of jobs.

64
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:15,040
I do whatever makes money.

65
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,519
You scam people out there,

66
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,279
and come home to scam your own daughter?

67
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,399
How can you say that?

68
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,920
How could Dad ever lie to you?

69
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,600
Impossible.

70
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,920
Who sent this to you?

71
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:37,519
It doesn't matter who sent it.

72
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:40,319
I'm just asking if it's true.

73
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,920
It's fake.

74
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,920
I'm just doing business.

75
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,920
You're still trying to lie to me even now?

76
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,279
Fine.

77
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,680
It doesn't matter if you won't admit it.

78
00:06:14,519 --> 00:06:15,920
Then starting today,

79
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,439
we will sever father-daughter ties.

80
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,399
Honey...

81
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,519
I'm begging you.

82
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:24,680
Just tell me straight up,

83
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:28,279
what do I need to do so you won't leave?

84
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,519
Turn yourself in.

85
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,399
No...

86
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,360
I mean...

87
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,600
I'm getting too old.

88
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,079
You're telling me to go to prison?

89
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:40,240
It's just...

90
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,720
I can't handle that kind of hardship.

91
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:51,680
I'm truly so disappointed in you.

92
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,120
Didn't you want to write a novel?

93
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,720
I bought you some reference books

94
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,839
and mystery collections.

95
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,720
I don't know if they'll be helpful.

96
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:50,920
Hey!

97
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:56,639
What are you doing?!

98
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,920
I swear I'll kill you today!

99
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,120
You bastard!

100
00:08:00,279 --> 00:08:00,920
You damn old man!

101
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,839
What are you doing?!

102
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:02,519
What do you think I'm doing?!

103
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,600
I'll kill you!

104
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,519
You dare fight back?!

105
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:07,519
Seriously, what are you doing?!

106
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:08,639
What am I doing?!

107
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:11,279
You told my daughter my real identity!

108
00:08:11,279 --> 00:08:12,720
Now she wants to sever father-daughter ties!

109
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,639
What am I doing?!

110
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,480
What the hell are you babbling about?

111
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,040
Since you called me last time

112
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,399
and told me to sever ties with Gu Ting,

113
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:19,879
I haven't contacted her again!

114
00:08:19,879 --> 00:08:21,120
Impossible!

115
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,199
Who else knows my identity but you?!

116
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:24,839
No, I swear I'll kill you!

117
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,439
It's the truth!

118
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:29,680
What good does it do me to cross you now?

119
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,240
Then why drive a wedge between us?

120
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,279
To keep my daughter all to yourself!

121
00:08:33,399 --> 00:08:34,240
Let me tell you,

122
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:35,919
I've got my own problems to worry about.

123
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:38,120
I'm getting close to the fraud ring boss.

124
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,600
Why would I complicate things?

125
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,720
What do you mean, your own problems?

126
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,799
My family

127
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,240
was killed by that man!

128
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:59,320
Who died in your family?

129
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:00,799
I can't tell you.

130
00:09:02,679 --> 00:09:04,120
I'll tell you when I find out.

131
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:06,480
And also,

132
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:08,000
I really don't know how Gu Ting

133
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,600
found out your real identity.

134
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,519
But if you play with fire,

135
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:12,679
you're bound to get burned.

136
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,480
What do I do now?

137
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,000
This daughter of mine,

138
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,840
she's really going to leave me this time.

139
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,799
Alright.

140
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,879
Just go home and wait.

141
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,000
I'll help you figure something out.

142
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,679
By the way,

143
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:35,879
I'm sorry about just now.

144
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:40,720
Let me wipe that for you.

145
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:41,519
No need.

146
00:09:41,519 --> 00:09:42,240
A bloody mess.

147
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,639
It doesn't look good.

148
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,159
Get away.

149
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:45,399
Just let me wipe it.

150
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,240
Get off me!

151
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,360
So annoying

152
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,399
Honey...

153
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:31,399
Just pick up the phone!

154
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:33,519
Why did you turn it off?

155
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:37,360
The number you dialed is powered off.

156
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,679
Please turn it on.

157
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,720
Honey...

158
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,519
Honey...

159
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:48,080
You're worrying your dad to death.

160
00:10:48,919 --> 00:10:49,879
I've looked everywhere.

161
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:50,879
I can't find her.

162
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,919
Wait, why are you here?

163
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:55,720
Around the school...

164
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,879
She's not where Gu Ting and I usually go.

165
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,320
Could something have happened to Tingting?

166
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:02,799
Think carefully.

167
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:05,600
Who else could tell Gu Ting your identity?

168
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,360
Well...

169
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:14,639
No one who knows me knows about Tingting.

170
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,519
And the people who know Tingting...

171
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,320
...couldn't possibly know my identity.

172
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,919
No, hold on.

173
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,120
I've helped you so many times.

174
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,639
You must help me this time, no matter what.

175
00:11:22,639 --> 00:11:23,519
You don't have to tell me.

176
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:25,519
Gu Ting is a good girl.

177
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,960
I can't let anything happen to her.

178
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,879
If you know that, why not do something?

179
00:11:28,879 --> 00:11:30,519
What good is it just standing around here?

180
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,360
Now what?

181
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:45,000
She's been kidnapped.

182
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,159
Wait.

183
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:49,919
How can you be sure she's been kidnapped?

184
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,679
This wasn't sent from a phone.

185
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:52,879
This is an Electronic signal.

186
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:55,120
I have a gift for you here.

187
00:11:58,679 --> 00:11:59,720
I've located her.

188
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:01,440
Where?

189
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,679
But the signal is very weak.

190
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:03,879
Hold it higher.

191
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,840
Higher, higher, higher.

192
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,120
Come on, check it!

193
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:08,879
It's not my signal.

194
00:12:08,879 --> 00:12:09,840
It's her signal.

195
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,720
If you hold it higher, won't she get it too?

196
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:13,679
Bro Liu.

197
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:14,919
Grass Snake.

198
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,200
They've got their eyes on you, right?

199
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:18,759
No.

200
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,279
The police are cracking down so hard now.

201
00:12:20,279 --> 00:12:21,679
Where could they possibly hide?

202
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:26,840
Sun Ming, Gu Yan and I suspect...

203
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,480
Grass Snake likely kidnapped Gu Ting.

204
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,360
It should be where they usually punish people.

205
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:31,039
I'll send you the notes.

206
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:31,919
Okay, I got it.

207
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,279
Xiao Lin.

208
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,840
Track it and alert the SWAT team at once.

209
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,559
Move out right now!

210
00:12:36,559 --> 00:12:37,039
Yes, sir!

211
00:13:02,279 --> 00:13:03,399
Who's there?

212
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,919
Is anyone there?

213
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,519
Who are you?

214
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:17,039
Who am I?

215
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,759
I'm...

216
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:26,600
Like I'd tell you that.

217
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,600
Help!

218
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,799
Is anybody out there?!

219
00:13:32,799 --> 00:13:34,320
Scream! Louder!

220
00:13:34,759 --> 00:13:36,320
Let's see if anyone comes to save you.

221
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:39,240
Louder!

222
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:43,759
Help!

223
00:13:44,559 --> 00:13:45,799
Help!
